	(text "IDENTICAL PASS-THROUGH PORTS: either may face upstream.\n1 = DC bus positive; 2 = power return; 3 = CAN-H; 4 = CAN-L.\nBoth ports share the same nets; the local inverter branches from this bus.\n\nR20: 120 ohm, DNP at intermediate nodes; populate at a physical bus end only.\nComplete CAN bus: exactly two end terminations; keep the debug stub short.\n\nUp to 8 nodes is a network target, subject to total DC current and cable limits.\nAMASS 20 A MAX / 85 K-rise test is not a qualified continuous system rating.\nBefore fabrication: independently verify mating polarity/keying and thermal rise."
		(at 139.7 137.16 0)
